		(at 120.7 53.5)
		(descr "3AG cartridge fuse (6.3 x 32 mm, 1/4 x 1-1/4 in), two Littelfuse 102/122 series straight-lead PC-pin clips (e.g. 01020074Z). Pads 1 and 1 are the two pins of one clip, pads 2 and 2 the other. Origin is the fuse centre. Dimensions from the Littelfuse 102/122 datasheet: 7.62 mm between a clip's pins, 34.21 mm (A = 1.347 in) outer pin to outer pin for a 1-1/4 in fuse, 1.98 mm holes. Applies to any 6.3 x 32 mm fuse that fits these clips: 312, 313, 314, 326, 505, 506, 508 series.")
